lone in an old farmhouse deep in the woods. Something in overalls is standing in the yard. Watching. Waiting.\n\nSurvive 7 nights. Each night, he gets smarter, faster, and harder to keep out.\n\n🔦 Find batteries for your flashlight before it dies\n🪵 Board up windows and push furniture against the doors\n🤫 Stay quiet. He hunts by sound.\n🛏️ Hide under beds, in closets and wardrobes\n📞 Answer the phone... or don't\n👥 Play solo or with up to 4 friends\n\nIf he catches you, you're out for the night. Spectate your friends and hope they make it to dawn.\n\nWill you survive all 7 nights?\n\n⚠️ Intense jumpscares and loud sounds. No blood or gore.\n\n👍 Like and ⭐ favorite for updates!\n\nShoutout to FoxyAnimations on YouTube for the inspiration!","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-652764f96a8728a77c9b4fef17176d24/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ada6b3166bcff11db1ba407b8b658ffd/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b4151f1d5ae8a17e06d57481b8a80246/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}